Source: konaro-installer
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Konaro OS Project <maintainers@konaro.invalid>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), librsvg2-bin
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: konaro-installer
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, calamares (>= 3.3), calamares-settings-debian (>= 13), konaro-common, konaro-store
Description: Konaro OS branding for the Calamares installer (live session only)
 Visual identity and launcher for installing Konaro OS from the live
 session. The installation modules and flow are the ones maintained by
 Debian in calamares-settings-debian.
 .
 The live image switches Calamares to this branding at build time; the
 package is removed from the installed system by the installer.
